---
import { site } from '../config'
import Icon from './Icon.astro'
import TitleRing from './TitleRing.astro'
---
<section class="download-wrap">
  <div class="section" id="download">
    <h2 class="section-title"><TitleRing i18n="download.title">下载</TitleRing></h2>
    <p class="section-sub" data-i18n="download.sub">跨平台可视化 Ren'Py 开发工具，支持 macOS 与 Windows。</p>
    <div class="version-line">
      <span class="badge">v{site.version}</span>
      <span style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px" data-i18n="download.latest">最新稳定版</span>
    </div>
    <div class="download-grid">
      <a class="dl-card" href={site.urls.releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="ico"><Icon name="apple" size={26} /></div>
        <h4>macOS</h4>
        <p data-i18n="download.dmg">.dmg 安装包</p>
      </a>
      <a class="dl-card" href={site.urls.releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="ico"><Icon name="windows" size={26} /></div>
        <h4>Windows</h4>
        <p data-i18n="download.exe">.exe 安装包</p>
      </a>
      <a class="dl-card" href={site.urls.releases} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <div class="ico"><Icon name="download" size={26} /></div>
        <h4><span data-i18n="download.all">全部版本</span></h4>
        <p>GitHub Releases</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="dl-note" data-i18n="download.note">
      安装后应用内置「检查更新」：自动对比官方 Releases，发现新版本会展示更新详情并引导下载安装。
      所有发行包均在 GitHub Releases 提供，欢迎前往查看更新说明与历史版本。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
